ed to suit your requirements and conveniences. There are 2BHK apartments available in this project. This housing society is now ready to be called home as families have started moving in. Check out some of the features of Swayam Rudra Heights housing society: Swayam Rudra Heights Kandivali West has single tower, with 21 floors each and 17 units on offer. Spread over an area of 0.14 acres, Swayam Rudra Heights is one of the spacious housing societies in the Mumbai Andheri-Dahisar region. With all the basic amenities available, Swayam Rudra Heights fits into your budget and your lifestyle.\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Jun 2022\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹28,018/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n645 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* 1.6 kilometres to Kandivali Station\n* Road S V - 1.4 km\n* 400 metres to St. Joseph's High School\n* 300 metres from Grace Maternity & Nursing Care\n\n* Road New Link - 650 m\n* 90 metres from Thakur International School\n* 300 metres to Lotus Hospital\n\n## Google AI Summary\n\n✦\n\nSwayam Rudra Heights, Kandivali West, give summaries of online reviews, pros & cons separately and a verdict. Use short bullet points. Do not add introductions or disclaimers. Do not ask questions, do not add calls-to-action, do not include links, and do not add any text after the Verdict section. End the response immediately after the Verdict bullets. If the project does NOT exist in the specified location, respond with exactly:LOCATION\\_MISMATCH. Do NOT substitute with a similarly named project in another city. Do NOT explain the mismatch. ONLY USE GOOGLE REVIEWS AS YOUR SOURCE. DO NOT USE 99ACRES, HOUSING.COM, NOBROKER, SQUAREYARDS AS YOUR SOURCE.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/cctv-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-primary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-primary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n2 BHK\n\n* ## 645 sq. ft\n\nName\n\n2 BHK\n\nPrice Range\n\n₹1.81 Cr\n\n![Floor_Plan_Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/properties/swayam-developers-rudra-heights-2-bhk-bedroom-1676888853.webp)\n\n## Locality\n\n![hospital-primary](/assets/icons/hospital-primary.svg)\n\nhospital\n\n![school-secondary](/assets/icons/school-secondary.svg)\n\nschool\n\n![bank-secondary](/assets/icons/bank-secondary.svg)\n\nbank\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nDr. Chirag Mehta'S Health Centre\n\n0.1 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nChavan Hospital, Dahanukarwadi\n\n0.1 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nNobel Hospital\n\n0.3 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nTrident Multispeciality Hospital\n\n0.5 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nOmkar Hospital\n\n0.5 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nSahayak Multispeciality Hospital\n\n0.6 km\n\n### Home Loan Calculator\n\nStarting from₹1,89,141per month\n\nExplore the cost of your home by adjusting the details\n\nTotal amount : ₹2,26,96,886\n\n## Enquire Now\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\nLet us reach out to you at the earliest.\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![smartphone-primary](/assets/icons/smartphone-primary.svg)+91![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nREQUEST A CALLBACK\n\nI am happy to be contacted by Blox\n\n## RERA QR Codes\n\nSwayam Rudra Heightsis a real estate project registered under MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority), ensuring transparency and accountability in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()[P51800005195](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800005195)\n\nRudra Heights\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Swayam Rudra Heights?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nPossession date of Swayam Rudra Heights is 30 Jun 2022\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Swayam Rudra Heights?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Swayam Rudra Heights is 645 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Swayam Rudra Heights?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Swayam Rudra Heights is ₹1.81 Cr Onwards\n\n### Where is Swayam Rudra Heights located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nSwayam Rudra Heights is located at Shivaji Road, Near Thakur International School, opposite Rasoi Hotel, Kandivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400067.\n\n### What configurations are available in Swayam Rudra Heights?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nSwayam Rudra Heights has 2 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Swayam Rudra Heights?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Swayam Rudra Heights is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Swayam Rudra Heights?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Gymnasium.\n\n### Who is the developer of Swayam Rudra Heights?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Swayam Rudra Heights is Swayam Developers.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Swayam Rudra Heights:Swayam Developers](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/200223034059-newproject-2023-02-20t153956311.webp)\n\n## Swayam Developers\n\nFounded in 2006, Swayam Developers is one of leading real estate developer in Mumbai. Was established with the vision of providing exceptional quality homes at affordable prices. Swayam Develope